). They were not only devotees of कृष्ण but also great scholars who were instrumental in formulating the Acintyabhedābheda philosophy of the चैतन्य cult.
At that time वृन्दाबन्, the place connected with the childhood days of कृष्ण, was in a very bad shape. चैतन्य commanded Sanātana to rediscover and reclaim all the important places and convert it into a good place of पिल्ग्रिमगे, especially for the devotees of कृष्ण. Sanātana succeeded in the task admirably.
